   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "One character, several poses on one wide sheet (front, side, back, action).\nThe input picture is your character (any pose); IP-Adapter Plus copies their look (Character weight 0.6: higher = closer copy, but the poses get stiffer).\nDescribe the character in the prompt too (hair, clothes, colours): the sheet layout words are in the prompt already.\nSmall faces on a sheet are soft: run the result through \"Fix faces and hands\" for sharp faces.\nFor anime characters switch the checkpoint to an Illustrious model.\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 5.0, dpmpp_2m_sde / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
